            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HDR 照片未能完成编码，原片已保留，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The RAW frames have inconsistent exposure settings. Fusion could not finish; the originals were kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
