            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机已中断，请轻点“重试相机”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The capture was interrupted. Any delivered originals were kept. You can discard the incomplete capture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拍摄已中断。已交付的原片会保留，你可以放弃这次未完成的拍摄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The capture was interrupted. Check its status, then tap Retry camera.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拍摄已中断，请检查拍摄状态，再轻点“重试相机”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clear central frame is your photo. The outer glass darkens when camera views cannot align reliably.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中央清晰区域就是成片范围。多摄画面无法可靠对齐时，外围玻璃会变黑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current exposure is too short for F5. Try a scene with less light.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前曝光时间过短，无法完成 F5 拍摄。请尝试光线稍暗的场景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The main camera did not become ready for recording.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主摄未能准备好，无法开始记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo could not be processed. Its source was kept; try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片未能完成处理，原片已保留，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo's capture information could not be preserved. Its source has been retained for retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法完整保留照片的拍摄信息，原片已留存以便重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo's saved state changed. Reopen it before retrying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片的保存状态已改变，请重新打开后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The retained RAW files could not be verified. They have been kept for recovery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留的 RAW 文件未通过校验，文件已留存以便恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The retained photo could not be verified. Its files have been kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留的照片未通过校验，文件已留存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The retained source could not be opened. Its files were kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法打开保留的原片，文件已留存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is not enough memory to finish this photo. The originals were kept. Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内存不足，暂时无法完成照片。原片已保留，请稍后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This RAW capture could not be processed with its camera information. The originals were kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法按这张 RAW 的相机信息完成处理，原片已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This image could not be decoded. Try a JPEG, PNG, HEIC, or supported DNG.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法解码这张图像，请使用 JPEG、PNG、HEIC 或受支持的 DNG。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This native LUT asset is unavailable. Choose another look or family.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此原生 LUT 不可用，请选择其他风格或系列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This photo cannot be processed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法处理这张照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This photo cannot use the requested output dimensions. Its source was kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这张照片无法使用所选输出尺寸，原片已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This photo could not be reconstructed. The originals were kept; you can retry or discard it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "照片未能完成重建，原片已保留。你可以重试或放弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This photo may already be in Photos. A copy is retained here. Check Photos before saving it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这张照片可能已在系统相册中，应用内仍保留副本。请先检查相册，再决定是否再次保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This photo style is unavailable. Choose another style.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此照片风格暂不可用，请选择其他风格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This retained photo uses an unsupported recovery format. Its files have been kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这张照片的恢复格式暂不受支持，文件已留存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To add sharpening or grain to FFCS looks, enable additional reference adjustments in Advanced.": {
